# A Tour level's area is a hint, not a wall. The Castro (area x -695 to -495, y -295 to 35),
# its clock cut to 10 s here: 45 m outside it (on a lot east of it) the wrong-way hint comes up
# (levelWrongWay, more than wrongWay.away 25 m out); 16 m out it stays up (it clears within
# wrongWay.back 15 m); back at Harvey Milk Plaza it clears (levelBack). The run goes on to the end.
park sf
cmd 0 traffic clear
cmd 0 setData tour.seconds 10
cmd 0 run level castro
cmd 100 teleport -455 55 11.8 90
cmd 300 teleport -479 25 16.9 90
cmd 500 teleport harvey_milk
run 1500
expect event levelStart{level=castro,seconds=10} within 0..2
expect event levelWrongWay{level=castro} within 100..103
expect event levelWrongWay count == 1
expect no event levelBack within 0..500
expect event levelBack{level=castro} within 500..503
expect event levelOver{level=castro,score=0,tape=false} within 1199..1210
expect no event runOver
